                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cbd2809-63ef-4904-b405-8441fec0246c",
                                "sense_id": "f2695b55-b7b0-34be-a973-5bc644e47a64",
                                "text": "Ве́чером Передо́нову принесли́ запи́ску от Гудаевской. Он прочёл:\n\"Достоуважа́емый Ардальо́н Бори́сыч!\nМуж ушёл в клуб, и тепе́рь я свобо́дна от его́ ва́рварства до ча́су но́чи.[...]",
                                "translation": "In the evening Peredonov received a note from Goudayevskaya. It ran :\n\" Most esteemed Ardalyon Borisitch,\n\" My husband has gone to his club, and now I am free from his savagery until one o'clock.…",
                                "english": "In the evening Peredonov received a note from Goudayevskaya. It ran :\n\" Most esteemed Ardalyon Borisitch,\n\" My husband has gone to his club, and now I am free from his savagery until one o'clock.…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
